{"full":"hf:pseudolab/MiniMed_EHR_Analyst","spaceId":"pseudolab/MiniMed_EHR_Analyst","name":"MiniMed EHR Analyst","source":"huggingface","description":"An interactive AI application on Hugging Face Spaces.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","topics":["streamlit","region:us"],"technologies":["Python"],"likes":5,"created":"2023-11-05T20:28:58.000Z","updated":"2023-11-10T01:52:38.000Z","license":"apache-2.0","runtime":"SLEEPING","appUrl":"https://pseudolab-minimed-ehr-analyst.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/pseudolab/MiniMed_EHR_Analyst","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T19:05:05.744Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T19:05:05.744Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T19:05:05.744Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"⚡","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This program represents a groundbreaking intersection of open-source technology and healthcare, opening up new possibilities for patient care and medical research.","The script you're looking at is a powerful tool that leverages the capabilities of Hugging Face's state-of-the-art language models fine-tuned on medical data. It's designed to analyze Electronic Health Records (EHRs), which are digital versions of patients' paper charts. EHRs are real-time, patient-centered records that make information available instantly and securely to authorized users.","By connecting open EHR data systems like OpenEMR with Hugging Face's open-source language models, we can unlock a wealth of insights. OpenEMR is a popular open-source electronic health records and medical practice management solution, and its integration with Hugging Face's models can revolutionize how we understand and use EHR data."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/pseudolab/MiniMed_EHR_Analyst/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"269d2ac75152de958fe6029eb32454fd290a3fd445713baf109298b2084db01c","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T18:18:47.913Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-16